strings.ui.techniques.verse_wood:
The root is patient;
the bough remembers
every spring.

strings.ui.techniques.verse_fire:
A spark asks nothing;
the forge answers
with a sword.

strings.ui.techniques.verse_water:
A spring is small;
a hundred springs
are a river.

strings.ui.techniques.verse_space:
Every road bends;
the far star
is near to itself.

strings.ui.techniques.verse_time:
The water clock drips;
each drop
a door.

strings.ui.techniques.verse_lost:
What the world forgets
it does not lose;
it hides.

strings.ui.techniques.verse_secret:
The feet learn first;
the heart follows
the feet.
